WEBVTT

00:08.000 --> 00:09.586
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.689 --> 00:11.724
KIDS:
Aye, aye, Captain.
儿童：
是的，是的，船长。

00:11.827 --> 00:13.482
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.586 --> 00:14.827
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.931 --> 00:17.931
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.034 --> 00:20.517
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.620 --> 00:22.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:22.586 --> 00:24.482
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.586 --> 00:26.517
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:26.620 --> 00:28.482
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.586 --> 00:30.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:30.172 --> 00:32.448
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.551 --> 00:34.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪Ready?
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪ 准备好了吗？

00:34.586 --> 00:36.448
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.551 --> 00:38.620
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.724 --> 00:40.379
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.482 --> 00:44.103
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:44.206 --> 00:46.655
[ hearty laughter]
[爽朗的笑声]

00:46.758 --> 01:05.517
Captioning sponsored by
MTV NETWORKS
字幕赞助商
MTV 网络

01:05.620 --> 01:07.241
One Monster
Krabby Patty, please.
一只怪物
克拉比帕蒂，请。

01:07.344 --> 01:10.448
Humph. No one's ordered
a Monster Patty in ages.
哼。没有人下单
多年来的怪物帕蒂。

01:10.551 --> 01:11.448
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

01:11.551 --> 01:13.034
One Monster Krabby Patty.
一只怪物蟹蟹帕蒂。

01:14.931 --> 01:17.793
D-d-did you say
a M-Monster Krabby Patty?
D-D-你说
M-Monster 蟹黄派蒂？

01:17.896 --> 01:20.000
Uh, one Monster Krabby Patty.
呃，一只怪物蟹蟹帕蒂。

01:20.103 --> 01:20.758
Huh?
啊？

01:20.862 --> 01:22.758
Monster Krabby Patty?
怪物蟹蟹帕蒂？

01:22.862 --> 01:24.827
ALL:
Monster Krabby Patty?
全部：
怪物蟹蟹帕蒂？

01:24.931 --> 01:27.103
[ toilet flushing]Monster Krabby Patty?
[冲厕所]怪物蟹蟹帕蒂？

01:29.172 --> 01:30.172
Oh, dear Neptune.
哦，亲爱的海王星。

01:30.275 --> 01:32.000
Oh, boy.
哦，男孩。

01:32.793 --> 01:34.034
We can do this!
我们可以做到这一点！

01:34.137 --> 01:35.965
At the count of three, we flip!
数到三，我们翻转！

01:36.068 --> 01:37.034
Ready?
准备好？

01:37.137 --> 01:38.655
One...
一...

01:38.758 --> 01:39.689
two...
二...

01:39.793 --> 01:40.689
three!
三！

01:40.793 --> 01:43.172
[ spatula snaps]Oh... bad.
[抹刀啪地一声]哦……糟糕。

01:43.275 --> 01:44.758
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

01:44.862 --> 01:46.862
[ squeaking]
[吱吱声]

01:46.965 --> 01:49.965
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

01:50.068 --> 01:58.482
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]

01:58.586 --> 02:01.724
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]

02:01.827 --> 02:04.793
[ wailing][ wailing]
[哀嚎][哀嚎]

02:04.896 --> 02:07.241
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]

02:07.344 --> 02:11.586
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]

02:11.689 --> 02:13.206
Mm-hmm.
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。
嗯嗯。

02:13.310 --> 02:14.137
Go on.
继续。

02:14.241 --> 02:16.724
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]

02:16.827 --> 02:20.482
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]

02:20.586 --> 02:23.655
[ wailing]
[ wailing]
[哀嚎]
[哀嚎]

02:23.758 --> 02:25.413
[ siren wailing]
[警笛哀嚎]

02:25.517 --> 02:26.413
[ door shuts]
[门关上]

02:26.517 --> 02:27.517
[ tires screeching]
[轮胎吱吱作响]

02:27.620 --> 02:29.206
Well, we'd better
get back to work.
嗯，我们最好
回去工作吧。

02:29.310 --> 02:30.586
Work?
工作？

02:30.689 --> 02:33.896
How could I go back to work
without...
我怎样才能回去工作
没有...

02:34.000 --> 02:35.034
without Spat?!
没有口角？！

02:35.137 --> 02:36.241
Use another spatula.
使用另一把抹刀。

02:36.344 --> 02:37.586
What?!
什么？！

02:37.689 --> 02:40.344
There is only one spatula
for me,
只有一把锅铲
对我来说，

02:40.448 --> 02:41.827
and that is Spat.
那就是吐口水。

02:41.931 --> 02:44.689
Spat, wait up! Spat!
吐槽，等等！吐口水！

02:44.793 --> 02:46.620
I'm coming, Spat!
我来了，斯帕特！

02:47.517 --> 02:49.862
[ beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

02:49.965 --> 02:50.931
Oh, Spat.
哦，斯帕特。

02:51.034 --> 02:54.689
We've been through
so much together.
我们已经经历过
在一起这么多。

02:57.000 --> 02:58.620
[ sizzling]
[铁板]

03:04.758 --> 03:06.862
[ sizzling]
[铁板]

03:10.137 --> 03:11.931
[ laughing]
[笑]

03:15.344 --> 03:16.448
Oh...
哦...

03:16.551 --> 03:18.000
uh-huh...
呃呃...

03:26.689 --> 03:28.413
[ clanking]
[叮当作响]

03:36.034 --> 03:38.241
[ laughing]
[笑]

03:40.965 --> 03:43.310
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

03:45.068 --> 03:48.000
[ laughing]
[笑]

03:48.103 --> 03:50.379
There's no easy way
to say this.
没有简单的方法
说这个。

03:50.482 --> 03:51.724
SpongeBob, if I were you,
海绵宝宝，如果我是你，

03:51.827 --> 03:54.137
I would give serious
consideration
我会认真的
考虑

03:54.241 --> 03:57.655
to start thinking about...
a replacement spatula.
开始思考...
替换抹刀。

03:57.758 --> 03:59.896
[ whimpering]
[呜咽]

04:00.000 --> 04:01.724
Go home, get some rest.
回家休息吧。

04:01.827 --> 04:04.655
We'll... try to do
everything we can.
我们会...尝试做
我们能做的一切。

04:04.758 --> 04:06.758
Thank you, Doctor.
谢谢你，医生。

04:06.862 --> 04:08.068
Oh, I'm not a doctor.
哦，我不是医生。

04:08.172 --> 04:10.931
I'm an actor
researching for a role.
我是一名演员
研究角色。

04:11.034 --> 04:12.482
Yes! Whoo-hoo!
是的！呼呼！

04:12.586 --> 04:15.068
I am so totally
gonna get this part!
我是如此彻底
会得到这个部分！

04:15.172 --> 04:16.724
[ sighs]
[叹气]

04:22.379 --> 04:23.758
[ sniffling]
[抽鼻子]

04:23.862 --> 04:27.103
Replacement spatula?
更换抹刀？

04:27.206 --> 04:29.448
How could anything
ever replace...
怎么可能有事
曾经更换...

04:29.551 --> 04:31.103
Hey, look at that!
嘿，看看那个！

04:33.724 --> 04:35.172
Ooh!
哦！

04:35.862 --> 04:36.862
Looks fancy.
看起来很别致。

04:36.965 --> 04:39.103
So shiny...
如此闪亮...

04:40.034 --> 04:42.689
Oh, those lines, so... sleek.
哦，那些线条，如此……光滑。

04:42.793 --> 04:44.137
What am I talking about?
我在说什么？

04:44.241 --> 04:45.724
I don't need this!
我不需要这个！

04:47.448 --> 04:50.275
Maybe I do need this.
也许我确实需要这个。

04:51.724 --> 04:53.896
I would give serious
consideration to...
我会认真的
考虑到...

04:54.000 --> 04:55.241
[ gong chimes]
[锣声]

04:55.344 --> 04:58.482
...a replacement spatula.
...替换抹刀。

05:00.034 --> 05:01.655
Ow!
噢！

05:01.758 --> 05:04.310
Uh-uh. No touchy-touchy
the Le Spatula.
呃呃。不敏感不敏感
锅铲。

05:04.413 --> 05:07.448
It's very, very
expensive.
I'm sorry.
这是非常非常
昂贵。
对不起。

05:07.551 --> 05:09.896
Of course, if you
purchase this fine item,
当然，如果你
购买这件精美的商品，

05:10.000 --> 05:11.620
you may... hold it.
你可以……坚持住。

05:11.724 --> 05:14.000
Well, I've got some
loose change in my pocket.
嗯，我有一些
我口袋里的零钱。

05:14.103 --> 05:15.206
Will this cover it?
这个会覆盖吗？

05:15.310 --> 05:17.137
Um....
嗯……

05:17.241 --> 05:20.034
mm, mm, mm...
mm, mm, mm, mm, mm...
毫米，毫米，毫米……
毫米，毫米，毫米，毫米，毫米……

05:20.137 --> 05:21.137
mm...
毫米...

05:21.241 --> 05:22.758
No.
不。

05:23.689 --> 05:24.793
How about now?
现在怎么样？

05:24.896 --> 05:25.931
No.
不。

05:26.034 --> 05:27.172
Now?
现在？

05:27.275 --> 05:28.275
No.
不。

05:28.379 --> 05:30.103
Now?
No.
现在？
不。

05:30.206 --> 05:31.896
Now?
No.
现在？
不。

05:32.000 --> 05:33.827
Now?
No.
现在？
不。

05:33.931 --> 05:36.034
[ high-pitched blurt]
[高亢的脱口而出]

05:36.137 --> 05:37.172
Now?
现在？

05:37.275 --> 05:38.482
No.
不。

05:40.862 --> 05:42.275
That's everything I have.
这就是我所拥有的一切。

05:42.379 --> 05:44.344
Now can I buy Le Spatula?
现在我可以购买 Le Spatula 吗？

05:44.448 --> 05:46.310
Everything, huh?
一切，是吗？

05:46.413 --> 05:48.655
Nice outfit.
不错的衣服。

05:48.758 --> 05:50.206
[ singing happily]
[快乐地唱歌]

05:50.310 --> 05:51.172
Good evening, sir.
晚上好，先生。

05:51.275 --> 05:52.103
Yaah!
呀啊！

05:52.206 --> 05:54.103
[ whistling]
[吹口哨]

05:54.206 --> 05:55.172
Hmph!
哼！

05:55.275 --> 05:57.068
Oh!
Hey, Granny,
what's shakin'?
哦！
嘿，奶奶，
什么在摇晃？

05:57.172 --> 05:58.448
[ singing]
[唱歌]

05:58.551 --> 06:01.551
[ continues singing]
[继续唱歌]

06:01.655 --> 06:03.517
Mm, breezy today, heh.
嗯，今天风很大，呵呵。

06:03.620 --> 06:06.172
Nice outfit, SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝，这套衣服不错！

06:06.275 --> 06:08.206
[ snorting, guffawing]
[哼哼，大笑]

06:08.310 --> 06:09.482
Thanks, Squidward.
谢谢，章鱼哥。

06:09.586 --> 06:11.000
It was worth
every penny.
这是值得的
每一分钱。

06:11.103 --> 06:13.379
What's all
the lollygagging about?!
全部是什么
棒棒糖呕吐有关？！

06:13.482 --> 06:16.931
Mr. Krabs,
get a load of SpongeBob!
蟹老板先生，
得到海绵宝宝的负载！

06:17.034 --> 06:19.758
[ cackling]This better be good!
[咯咯笑]这最好是好的！

06:19.862 --> 06:21.103
[ singing happily]
[快乐地唱歌]

06:21.206 --> 06:24.068
Soon everyone will know
of your beauty.
很快大家就会知道
你的美丽。

06:24.172 --> 06:27.000
All right,
what's going on in... Oh!
好吧，
这是怎么回事……哦！

06:27.827 --> 06:30.275
Don't you have
any shame, boy?
你没有吗
有什么羞耻的吗，孩子？

06:30.379 --> 06:32.379
All my shame went in here,
Mr. Krabs.
我所有的耻辱都集中在这里，
蟹老板。

06:32.482 --> 06:33.758
KRABS:
Le Spa-tu-ler!
螃蟹：
Le Spa-tu-ler！

06:33.862 --> 06:35.655
What in blazes isthat?
火焰中那是什么？

06:35.758 --> 06:38.517
Oh, just the answer to our
little production dilemma.
哦，这只是我们的答案
生产困境不大。

06:40.103 --> 06:41.586
Well, what can it do?
嗯，它能做什么呢？

06:41.689 --> 06:43.137
Can it make me famous?
能让我出名吗？

06:43.241 --> 06:46.620
Anything you want and more!
任何你想要的，甚至更多！

06:46.724 --> 06:47.896
Ooh, that sounds exciting.
哦，听起来很令人兴奋。

06:48.000 --> 06:49.689
Let me have a go at it!
让我来试试吧！

06:49.793 --> 06:52.379
Oh, I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs,
no can do.
哦，对不起，蟹老板，
没有可以做的。

06:52.482 --> 06:55.103
What?! Are you going against
your commanding officer?
什么？！你反对吗
你的指挥官？

06:55.206 --> 06:56.620
No, it's not that.
不，不是那样的。

06:56.724 --> 06:59.758
It's just that this is a highly
developed piece of engineering
只是这是一个高度
开发的工程

06:59.862 --> 07:02.172
that takes quality time
to master.
这需要优质的时间
掌握。

07:02.275 --> 07:04.344
With that fancy machinery,
I expect you
有了那些奇特的机械，
I expect you

07:04.448 --> 07:06.482
to make Krabby Patties
twice as fast.
制作蟹黄饼
速度快两倍。

07:06.586 --> 07:09.413
Oh, I don't think
that'll be a problem, Mr. Krabs.
哦，我不认为
这将是一个问题，蟹老板。

07:09.517 --> 07:10.655
In fact...
实际上...

07:10.758 --> 07:12.379
[ French accent]:
Le Spatula 3000,
[法国口音]：
抹刀 3000，

07:12.482 --> 07:13.896
at your service.
竭诚为您服务。

07:14.000 --> 07:15.793
Huh! Impressive.
哈！感人的。

07:15.896 --> 07:18.413
Well, let's see that thing
impress me even more--
好吧，让我们看看那个东西
更让我印象深刻的是——

07:18.517 --> 07:19.827
by bringing in
more customers
通过引入
更多客户

07:19.931 --> 07:21.551
and more money
in me pocket.
和更多的钱
in me pocket.

07:21.655 --> 07:23.310
[ chuckling]
[轻笑]

07:23.413 --> 07:26.793
Oh, you won't believe what
Le Spatula is capable of.
哦，你不会相信什么
Le Spatula 有能力。

07:26.896 --> 07:28.344
Ready to show 'em, buddy?
准备好向他们展示了吗，伙计？

07:28.448 --> 07:31.034
Oh, it's okay,
no need to be shy.
哦，没关系，
无需害羞。

07:31.137 --> 07:33.758
It's always tough
the first day on the job.
总是很难
the first day on the job.

07:33.862 --> 07:36.448
Uh, can I get one
Krabby Patty, please?
呃，我可以买一个吗
克拉比帕蒂，可以吗？

07:36.551 --> 07:39.000
SpongeBob, I need
one Krabby Patty.
海绵宝宝，我需要
一份蟹肉饼。

07:39.103 --> 07:42.275
One Krabby Patty coming up
lickety-split.
一只蟹肉饼即将登场
迅速分裂。

07:44.172 --> 07:45.413
Huh?
啊？

07:48.689 --> 07:50.758
Spat, is there
something wrong, pal?
吐口水，有吗
有什么问题吗，朋友？

07:50.862 --> 07:54.034
I would not dare touch such slop
as this, how you say,
我不敢碰这样的泥水
就这样，你怎么说，

07:54.137 --> 07:55.586
Krabby Patty!
蟹蟹帕蒂！

07:55.689 --> 07:58.551
I am designed for the utmost
in culinary cuisine.
我的设计是为了最大限度
在烹饪美食中。

07:58.655 --> 07:59.724
No less!
不少！

07:59.827 --> 08:02.931
But... but I thought
we were friends.
但是……但是我以为
我们是朋友。

08:03.034 --> 08:04.413
Friends with you? Ha!
和你是朋友吗？哈!

08:04.517 --> 08:07.344
We are not even
in the same social class!
我们甚至都不是
在同一个社会阶层！

08:10.413 --> 08:13.724
Have a nice life of mediocrity,
fry cook!
过着平庸的美好生活，
炒菜做饭！

08:13.827 --> 08:15.413
[ wild laughter]
[狂笑]

08:15.517 --> 08:17.689
Le Spatula, wait!
铲子，等等！

08:17.793 --> 08:20.517
I gave up everything for you!
为了你我放弃了一切！

08:20.620 --> 08:22.517
We had something!
我们有东西！

08:23.758 --> 08:25.689
How's thatfor something?
怎么样？

08:25.793 --> 08:26.793
Au revoir, peasant!
再见了，农民！

08:26.896 --> 08:30.413
Have fun ladling
in your greasy spoon!
享受舀勺的乐趣
在你油腻的勺子里！

08:30.517 --> 08:31.965
[ spits loudly]
[大声吐口水]

08:32.068 --> 08:33.758
What happened?!
发生了什么？！

08:33.862 --> 08:36.137
My spatula's gone, Mr. Krabs!
我的铲子不见了，蟹老板！

08:36.241 --> 08:38.068
But how are you
gonna flip Krabby Patties
但你怎么样
会翻转蟹黄馅饼

08:38.172 --> 08:39.931
without a spatu-ler?!
没有铲子？！

08:40.034 --> 08:42.068
I hada spatula once,
我曾经有过一次锅铲，

08:42.172 --> 08:43.896
a realspatula,
一把真正的抹刀，

08:44.000 --> 08:46.931
one that stood by me
through thick and thin,
站在我身边的人
经历了厚重和薄弱，

08:47.034 --> 08:48.896
through grease and gristle,
通过油脂和软骨，

08:49.000 --> 08:51.241
and I betrayed his loyalty...
而我背叛了他的忠诚...

08:51.344 --> 08:52.758
like a fool!
像个傻瓜！

08:52.862 --> 08:55.724
I always did like
your old spatu-ler.
我一直喜欢
你的老铲子。

08:55.827 --> 08:59.172
He got the job done
right every time.
他完成了工作
每次都是对的。

08:59.275 --> 09:01.448
[ gasps]:
You're right, Mr. Krabs.
[喘气]：
你是对的，蟹老板。

09:01.551 --> 09:05.689
The truemeasure of a good
spatula is by his actions,
衡量一个人好坏的真正标准
铲子是通过他的行动，

09:05.793 --> 09:08.310
not by some fancy chrome
and buttons!
不是一些花哨的镀铬物
和按钮！

09:08.413 --> 09:10.655
I've got to find my old spatula!
我得找到我的旧抹刀！

09:10.758 --> 09:13.482
Go to him!
Go now, boy!
去找他吧！
现在就走吧，孩子！

09:13.586 --> 09:16.137
Go before I lose
all me customers!
在我输掉之前走吧
都是我的顾客！

09:16.241 --> 09:18.172
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:18.275 --> 09:20.103
[ beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

09:20.206 --> 09:22.413
[ steady tone]
[稳定的语气]

09:23.655 --> 09:24.965
Spatula?
抹刀？

09:25.068 --> 09:26.137
It can't be true!
这不可能是真的！

09:26.241 --> 09:28.793
[ crying]:
It's too late!
[哭泣]：
太晚了！

09:28.896 --> 09:32.206
SpongeBob, I... I
hate to tell you this.
海绵宝宝，我...我
不想告诉你这个。

09:32.310 --> 09:36.689
I know! He's moved on to that
big kitchen drawer in the sky!
我知道！他已经转向那个了
天空中的大厨房抽屉！

09:36.793 --> 09:38.896
[ sniffles]:
He's... gone!
[抽鼻子]：
他……走了！

09:39.000 --> 09:40.517
Actually,
it's not that.
事实上，
不是那样的。

09:40.620 --> 09:42.482
I didn't get
the acting part.
我没有得到
表演部分。

09:42.586 --> 09:43.965
Oh, I'm so sorry.
哦，我很抱歉。

09:44.068 --> 09:46.448
[ sobbing]Oh, by the way,
[抽泣]哦，顺便说一下，

09:46.551 --> 09:48.103
that's not your spatula.
那不是你的抹刀。

09:48.206 --> 09:50.413
Your buddy's all patched
up in the infirmary.
你的好友已经打好补丁了
在医务室里。

09:52.551 --> 09:54.620
[ gasps]:
Spatula!
[喘气]：
锅铲！

09:54.724 --> 09:57.620
Old buddy!
Oh, I'm so glad you're better!
老伙计！
哦，我很高兴你好多了！

09:57.724 --> 09:59.724
[ squeaks]
[吱吱声]

09:59.827 --> 10:01.310
Spatula, what's wrong?
铲子，怎么了？

10:01.413 --> 10:02.724
[ squeaks]
[吱吱声]

10:02.827 --> 10:05.068
But I didn't mean to betray you.
但我并不是有意背叛你。

10:05.172 --> 10:06.793
Mr. Krabs needed a replacement.
蟹老板需要一个替代者。

10:06.896 --> 10:09.310
Krabby Patties don't flip
themselves, you know.
蟹黄饼不会翻转
他们自己，你知道。

10:09.413 --> 10:11.896
It was a moment
of weakness!
那是一个时刻
弱点！

10:12.000 --> 10:14.724
[ sobbing]:
I'm sorry!
[抽泣]：
对不起！

10:14.827 --> 10:17.896
Oh, what have I done?!
哦，我做了什么？！

10:18.000 --> 10:19.586
What have I done?!
我做了什么？！

10:19.689 --> 10:22.827
[ loud sobbing]
[大声抽泣]

10:22.931 --> 10:25.172
[ loud blubbering]
[大声哭泣]

10:26.068 --> 10:29.620
All that glitters is not gold.
闪光的不一定都是金子。

10:31.241 --> 10:33.517
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:37.482 --> 10:39.793
Good-bye, best friend!
再见，最好的朋友！

10:39.896 --> 10:42.137
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:43.896 --> 10:46.137
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:47.896 --> 10:51.103
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:53.448 --> 10:55.620
[ sobbing, wailing]
[抽泣、哀号]

10:58.482 --> 11:01.517
I'll never find
another spatula like him again.
我永远找不到
又一个像他一样的铲子。

11:01.620 --> 11:03.517
[ sizzling]
[铁板]

11:04.896 --> 11:06.620
Spatula?
抹刀？

11:07.517 --> 11:08.827
You're back!
你回来了！

11:09.793 --> 11:13.586
[ romantic orchestral music
plays]
[ 浪漫管弦乐
播放]

11:17.000 --> 11:20.551
Oh, Spatula,
now that we're together again,
哦，抹刀，
既然我们又在一起了

11:20.655 --> 11:23.413
nothing will ever separate us.
没有什么能将我们分开。

11:23.517 --> 11:25.655
One Monster Krabby Patty.
一只怪物蟹蟹帕蒂。

11:27.482 --> 11:30.137
Okay, buddy, we can do this.
好吧，伙计，我们可以做到。

11:30.241 --> 11:32.827
Ready? One... two...
准备好？一……二……

11:32.931 --> 11:33.862
three!
三！

11:33.965 --> 11:35.241
[ loud snap]
[响亮的响声]

11:35.344 --> 11:38.137
Ooh! [ laughing]
哦！ [笑]

11:38.241 --> 11:40.103
[ SpongeBob laughing]
[海绵宝宝大笑]

11:57.379 --> 11:58.827
Nothing. Ah, well.
没有什么。啊，好吧。

11:58.931 --> 12:00.000
[ clinking]
[叮叮当当]

12:00.103 --> 12:01.862
That sounds like a quarter
crying for help.
听起来像四分之一
哭喊着寻求帮助。

12:04.620 --> 12:05.551
Come to papa!
快来找爸爸吧！

12:05.655 --> 12:07.448
Hold it right there, buddy.
就在那里，伙计。

12:07.551 --> 12:10.241
My son just dropped
that quarter.
我儿子刚摔倒
那个季度。

12:10.344 --> 12:12.793
Yeah? Well, that kid
looks pretty shifty to me.
是的？嗯，那个孩子
对我来说看起来很狡猾。

12:12.896 --> 12:15.827
How do I know
he didn't steal it?
我怎么知道
他没有偷吗？

12:15.931 --> 12:17.068
[ groans]
[呻吟]

12:17.172 --> 12:18.413
Hey!
嘿！

12:18.517 --> 12:21.379
That little brat's throwing
perfectly good money away!
那个小家伙在扔东西
完美的钱走了！

12:21.482 --> 12:23.379
Oh, so if I
can't have it,
哦，所以如果我
不能拥有它，

12:23.482 --> 12:24.862
no one...
没有人...

12:24.965 --> 12:28.620
I hope he throws all your
retirement money down a hole!
我希望他倾尽所有
退休金掉了个洞！

12:28.724 --> 12:30.551
Poor little quarter.
可怜的小季度。

12:30.655 --> 12:31.586
What the...?
什么……？

12:31.689 --> 12:33.862
This well is full of money!
这口井里装满了钱！

12:33.965 --> 12:35.862
Don't worry, little fellas!
别担心，小家伙们！

12:35.965 --> 12:37.724
I'll save you!
我来救你！

12:37.827 --> 12:40.896
[ grunting]
[咕噜声]

12:41.000 --> 12:43.931
Oh, it's no use.
哦，没用的。

12:44.034 --> 12:46.034
Me poop deck's too big.
我的粪便甲板太大了。

12:46.137 --> 12:47.413
Make a wish, dear.
许个愿吧，亲爱的。

12:47.517 --> 12:50.344
All my wishes
have already come true.
我所有的愿望
已经实现了。

12:50.448 --> 12:52.103
Oh, you.
哦，你。

12:52.206 --> 12:53.482
No!
不！

12:53.586 --> 12:55.827
I'll save you, money!
我来救你，钱！

12:55.931 --> 12:57.103
Gotcha!
明白了！

12:57.206 --> 13:00.172
What do you heartless
brutes think you're doing?!
你没心没肺做什么
畜生以为你在做什么？！

13:00.275 --> 13:02.482
Um, using the wishing well.
嗯，使用许愿井。

13:02.586 --> 13:04.724
Well, you toss in a coin
and make a wish.
好吧，你扔一枚硬币
并许愿。

13:04.827 --> 13:05.655
And then what?
然后呢？

13:05.758 --> 13:07.448
And that's it.
就是这样。

13:07.551 --> 13:09.275
Nothing else happens.It's fun!
没有发生任何其他事情，这很有趣！

13:09.379 --> 13:12.344
You mean suckers throw
money down a hole for fun?
你的意思是傻瓜扔
花钱去坑里玩？

13:12.448 --> 13:14.413
That's the greatest scam ever!
这是有史以来最大的骗局！

13:14.517 --> 13:16.793
Can we have our
quarter back now?
我们可以拥有我们的
现在回来了？

13:16.896 --> 13:18.827
SQUIDWARD:
SpongeBob,
章鱼哥：
海绵宝宝，

13:18.931 --> 13:20.517
why aren't those
patties ready?
为什么不是那些
肉饼准备好了吗？

13:20.620 --> 13:22.413
You can't rush
perfection.
你不能着急
完美。

13:22.517 --> 13:24.172
I'm not rushing perfection.
我并不急于追求完美。

13:24.275 --> 13:25.068
I'm rushing you!
我催你了！

13:25.172 --> 13:26.103
[ laughing]
[笑]

13:26.206 --> 13:27.241
Always the kidder,
Squidward.
永远都是个小孩子，
章鱼哥。

13:27.344 --> 13:28.310
[ grumbles]
[抱怨]

13:28.413 --> 13:30.137
Oh, this job stinks!
哦，这个工作太臭了！

13:30.241 --> 13:32.793
But at least I'm not
digging ditches.
但至少我不是
挖沟渠。

13:32.896 --> 13:34.206
KRABS:
Squidward! SpongeBob!
螃蟹：
章鱼哥！海绵宝宝！

13:34.310 --> 13:35.586
I got a new job for you.
我给你找到了一份新工作。

13:35.689 --> 13:38.379
KRABS:
X marks the spot
螃蟹：
X 标记该位置

13:38.482 --> 13:41.344
of the Eugene Krabs memorial
wishing well.
尤金·克拉布斯纪念馆
祝愿。

13:41.448 --> 13:43.862
A wishing well,
here?! Wow!
一口许愿井，
在这里？！哇！

13:43.965 --> 13:46.448
Don't you have to be dead
to have a memorial anything?
你不必死吗
有纪念什么吗？

13:46.551 --> 13:49.517
Oh, Squidward,
don't you believe in magic?
哦，章鱼哥，
你不相信魔法吗？

13:49.620 --> 13:52.482
Yeah, Squidward, don't
you believe in magic?
是啊，章鱼哥，别这样
你相信魔法吗？

13:52.586 --> 13:53.896
No, I don't!
不，我不！

13:54.000 --> 13:56.862
And neither does Mr. Krabs!Well, I do.
蟹老板也没有！嗯，我也有。

13:56.965 --> 13:59.620
This well's gonna make a
lot of dreams come true.
这口井将会产生
很多梦想成真。

13:59.724 --> 14:01.482
What's the first thing
you're gonna wish for?
第一件事是什么
你会想要什么？

14:01.586 --> 14:03.517
To be as far away
from you as possible.
想要尽可能远
尽可能从你那里得到。

14:03.620 --> 14:06.793
Come on, SpongeBob, this hole's
not gonna dig itself.
来吧，海绵宝宝，这个洞
不会自己挖。

14:06.896 --> 14:08.068
And I'm certainly
not gonna do it.
我当然
不会做的。

14:08.172 --> 14:09.931
Squidward, aren't
you excited?
章鱼哥不是吗
你兴奋吗？

14:10.034 --> 14:12.034
This is really
gonna help people.
这真是
会帮助人们。

14:12.137 --> 14:14.862
♪ Take a penny
and some magic ♪
♪ 拿一分钱
还有一些魔法♪

14:14.965 --> 14:17.551
♪ Even though your
life is tragic ♪
Hey!
♪ 即使你的
人生是悲惨的♪
嘿！

14:17.655 --> 14:20.758
♪ You can throw all your dreams
down the well ♪
♪ 你可以抛掉所有的梦想
下井♪

14:20.862 --> 14:23.172
♪ Although every day,
the pain grows ♪
♪ 虽然每天，
痛苦愈演愈烈♪

14:23.275 --> 14:25.551
♪ You'll ride unicorns
on rainbows ♪
♪ 你会骑独角兽
彩虹上♪

14:25.655 --> 14:29.000
♪ If you throw all your dreams
down the well ♪
♪ 如果你抛掉所有的梦想
下井♪

14:29.103 --> 14:31.724
♪ When your life's come apart
at the seams ♪
♪ 当你的生活分崩离析时
在接缝处♪

14:31.827 --> 14:34.448
♪ And you've given up
all your dreams ♪
♪ 而你已经放弃了
你所有的梦想♪

14:34.551 --> 14:35.827
♪ Here is just the means
♪ 这只是手段

14:35.931 --> 14:38.172
♪ To make those dreams
come true ♪
♪ 为了实现这些梦想
成真♪

14:38.275 --> 14:40.620
♪ No more sufferin',
no more sighin' ♪
♪ 不再受苦，
不再叹息♪

14:40.724 --> 14:43.413
Ow!♪ No more pain and
no more cryin' ♪
哎呀！♪ 不再有疼痛，
别再哭了♪

14:43.517 --> 14:46.758
I'm not crying!♪ When you throw all your
dreams down the well ♪
我没有哭！♪ 当你抛下所有的时候
梦见井下♪

14:49.482 --> 14:51.655
Well, Squidward,
what do you think?
嗯，章鱼哥，
你觉得怎么样？

14:51.758 --> 14:53.310
That was the worst song
I ever heard.
那是最糟糕的歌
我曾经听说过。

14:53.413 --> 14:55.827
But at least
this stupid well's finished.
但至少
这口蠢井完蛋了。

14:55.931 --> 14:56.965
It's beautiful!
很美丽！

14:57.068 --> 14:58.758
[ sniffing]
You smell that, boys?
[嗅嗅]
孩子们，你闻到了吗？

14:58.862 --> 15:00.586
That's the
smell of money!
这就是
金钱的味道！

15:00.689 --> 15:02.586
You mean magic,
don't you?
你说的是魔法，
你不是吗？

15:02.689 --> 15:03.931
All I can smell
is that Dumpster.
我能闻到的一切
是那个垃圾箱。

15:04.034 --> 15:05.344
[ flies buzzing]
[苍蝇嗡嗡叫]

15:05.448 --> 15:08.103
All right, Squidward, you
can go back to the register.
好吧，章鱼哥，你
可以回到寄存器。

15:08.206 --> 15:09.896
As long as
there's no singing.
只要
没有歌声。

15:10.000 --> 15:13.000
And I've got a date
with a Krabby Patty.
我有一个约会
和蟹肉饼。

15:13.103 --> 15:14.758
Hold on there,
SpongeBob.
坚持住，
海绵宝宝。

15:14.862 --> 15:16.586
Let me show you
your new station.
让我告诉你
你的新站。

15:16.689 --> 15:18.275
It's kind of
a promotion.
这有点像
促销。

15:18.379 --> 15:19.241
Sort of.
有点像。

15:19.344 --> 15:20.310
A promotion?!
升职？！

15:20.413 --> 15:22.344
Why do I have to go
down in the well?
为什么我必须走
井底下？

15:22.448 --> 15:24.310
To collect the money!
来收钱的！

15:24.413 --> 15:26.310
How long do I
have to stay down here?
我要多久
必须留在这里吗？

15:26.413 --> 15:27.689
See you in eight hours.
八小时后见。

15:27.793 --> 15:30.275
Thanks for the promotion.
感谢您的促销。

15:30.379 --> 15:33.586
It sure is dark
and scary in here.
天肯定黑了
这里很可怕。

15:33.689 --> 15:35.310
[ teeth chattering]
[牙齿打战]

15:39.620 --> 15:42.689
I sure wish I had
a fancy telescope.
我当然希望我有
一个奇特的望远镜

15:42.793 --> 15:44.862
One that works
underwater.
一个有效的
水下。

15:44.965 --> 15:47.206
That'd make me happier
than a june bug
那会让我更快乐
比六月的虫子

15:47.310 --> 15:48.655
at a porch light sale.
在门廊灯销售中。

15:48.758 --> 15:50.448
Our very first wish.
我们的第一个愿望。

15:50.551 --> 15:52.931
I can't wait till
it comes... Oh!
我等不及了
它来了……哦！

15:53.034 --> 15:55.896
I have presented you
with a monetary offering,
我已经向你介绍了
通过货币发行，

15:56.000 --> 15:57.482
as custom dictates.
按照惯例。

15:57.586 --> 15:59.931
My wish, nay, my command,
我的愿望，不，我的命令，

16:00.034 --> 16:01.655
is to be taller.
就是要长高。

16:01.758 --> 16:03.275
Just a little.
只是一点点。

16:03.379 --> 16:05.586
Just big enough
to crush my enemies
够大就好
粉碎我的敌人

16:05.689 --> 16:07.413
like the vermin they are!
他们就像害虫一样！

16:07.517 --> 16:09.310
Gosh... Ow!
天哪...噢！

16:09.413 --> 16:11.482
I wish I had a snazzy new boat.
我希望我有一艘时髦的新船。

16:11.586 --> 16:14.034
I want to be a hotrod mama.
我想成为一名热棒妈妈。

16:14.137 --> 16:14.827
[ gasps]
[喘气]

16:14.931 --> 16:16.586
[ slurping]
[吸吮]

16:16.689 --> 16:18.344
Hey!
嘿！

16:18.448 --> 16:20.172
Oh, my gosh!
Who said that?
哦，天哪！
谁说的？

16:20.275 --> 16:21.172
Patrick...!
帕特里克……！

16:21.275 --> 16:22.896
How do you know my name?
你怎么知道我的名字？

16:23.000 --> 16:24.448
Patrick, this is a wishing well.
帕特里克，这是一个许愿井。

16:24.551 --> 16:26.275
Just throw in a coin
and make a wish.
只需投入一枚硬币
并许愿。

16:26.379 --> 16:28.482
Okay, magical
talking trashcan.
好吧，神奇的
会说话的垃圾桶。

16:28.586 --> 16:29.724
[ coins jingling]
[金币叮当作响]

16:29.827 --> 16:32.000
I wish SpongeBob
were here to see this.
我希望海绵宝宝
我们来这里就是为了看到这个。

16:33.344 --> 16:35.551
Patrick...?!
帕特里克……？！

16:35.655 --> 16:37.068
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

16:37.172 --> 16:38.448
I got my wish.
我如愿以偿了。

16:38.551 --> 16:39.793
Patrick, you're
supposed to let go
帕特里克，你是
应该放手

16:39.896 --> 16:41.379
of the coin
when you throw it.
硬币的
当你扔它的时候。

16:41.482 --> 16:42.896
But I got my wish.
但我如愿以偿了。

16:43.000 --> 16:44.551
Well, we got six
and a half hours
嗯，我们有六个
一个半小时

16:44.655 --> 16:45.517
till the end of my shift.
直到我轮班结束。

16:45.620 --> 16:46.758
What do you
want to do now?
你做什么
现在想做什么？

16:46.862 --> 16:48.758
Tag! You're it.
Tag,
you're it.
标签！你就是它。
标签，
你就是它。

16:48.862 --> 16:49.758
Tag! You're it.
标签！你就是它。

16:49.862 --> 16:50.965
Tag! You're it.
Tag,
you're it.
标签！你就是它。
标签，
你就是它。

16:51.068 --> 16:52.379
Tag,
you're it.
Tag! You're it.
标签，
你就是它。
标签！你就是它。

16:52.482 --> 16:53.482
Tag! You're it.
标签！你就是它。

16:53.586 --> 16:55.965
SpongeBob, what kind
of haul did you get?
海绵宝宝，什么类型的
你得到了多少收获？

16:56.068 --> 16:57.724
I did great, Mr. Krabs.
我做得很好，蟹老板。

16:57.827 --> 17:00.655
I got a nickel from Sandy,
two pennies from Mrs. Puff,
我从桑迪那里得到了五分钱
帕夫太太的两便士，

17:00.758 --> 17:03.965
a penny from Plankton, and this
slightly used pair of dentures.
Plankton 的一分钱，还有这个
一副稍微用过的假牙。

17:04.068 --> 17:05.655
And I fell on my head.
我头朝下摔倒了。

17:05.758 --> 17:08.517
Well, I can probably get
a couple of bucks for Patrick.
嗯，我大概可以得到
给帕特里克几块钱。

17:08.620 --> 17:09.689
Nah.
不。

17:09.793 --> 17:11.448
You better just
send up the money.
你最好只是
把钱寄上去。

17:13.000 --> 17:16.172
This wishing well was a
wonderful idea, Mr. Krabs.
这口许愿井是一个
好主意，蟹老板。

17:16.275 --> 17:17.896
Has anyone's wish come true yet?
有人的愿望实现了吗？

17:18.000 --> 17:20.068
Uh... not yet.
呃……还没有。

17:20.172 --> 17:22.379
But I'm sure, if you believe
strong enough,
但我确信，如果你相信
足够强大，

17:22.482 --> 17:24.827
and dug deep enough,
并且挖得足够深，

17:24.931 --> 17:28.068
everyone's wishes
will come true.
大家的愿望
将会实现。

17:28.172 --> 17:29.241
Really?
真的吗？

17:29.344 --> 17:30.655
Yeah, sure, whatever.
是的，当然，无论如何。

17:30.758 --> 17:32.137
Can we come out now?
我们现在可以出来吗？

17:32.241 --> 17:33.344
Goodness, no.
天哪，不。

17:33.448 --> 17:34.482
You gotta stay down there
你必须呆在那里

17:34.586 --> 17:36.758
just in case any late-night
wishers come by.
以防万一深夜
许愿者过来。

17:36.862 --> 17:38.517
I'll be back for you at dawn.
天一亮我就回来接你。

17:38.620 --> 17:42.241
Oh... no one's wishes
are coming true.
唉……没人愿意
即将实现。

17:42.344 --> 17:43.655
What did we do wrong?
我们做错了什么？

17:43.758 --> 17:46.206
I know I believe hard enough.
我知道我足够坚定地相信。

17:46.310 --> 17:48.344
Maybe I just
didn't dig deep enough.
也许我只是
挖得不够深。

17:48.448 --> 17:49.793
What do you say, Patrick?
你说什么，帕特里克？

17:49.896 --> 17:51.758
Are you ready to dig
for some magic?
你准备好挖掘了吗
为了一些魔法？

17:51.862 --> 17:52.793
Yeah!
是的！

17:52.896 --> 17:55.137
♪ Oh, the magic
has gone missin' ♪
♪ 哦，魔法
失踪了♪

17:55.241 --> 17:57.413
♪ And everyone's still wishin'
♪ 每个人都仍然希望

17:57.517 --> 18:00.862
♪ But their dreams have fallen
flat upon the ground ♪
♪ 但他们的梦想已经破灭
平放在地上♪

18:00.965 --> 18:03.310
♪ You'll find magic
under rubble ♪
♪ 你会发现魔法
废墟下♪

18:03.413 --> 18:05.827
♪ So, Patrick, grab a shovel
♪ 所以，帕特里克，拿把铲子

18:05.931 --> 18:09.206
♪ And here is where
the magic can be found ♪
♪ 这就是地方
魔法可以被发现♪

18:09.310 --> 18:11.620
♪ We're at the bottom
of a well ♪
♪ 我们在底部
一口井的♪

18:11.724 --> 18:14.172
♪ But, man, won't it be swell
♪ 但是，伙计，它不会膨胀吗？

18:14.275 --> 18:19.517
♪ When we make everyone's wishes
all come true? ♪
♪ 当我们实现每个人的愿望时
一切都成真了吗？ ♪

18:24.413 --> 18:25.793
Holy mackerel!
圣鲭鱼！

18:25.896 --> 18:26.827
Look, Patrick!
看，帕特里克！

18:26.931 --> 18:28.655
We've struck magic!
我们已经施展魔法了！

18:28.758 --> 18:29.689
Is that good?
这样好吗？

18:29.793 --> 18:30.965
Next to being a fry cook,
除了当一名炒菜厨师，

18:31.068 --> 18:33.379
it's the most important
thing I've ever done.
这是最重要的
我曾经做过的事情。

18:33.482 --> 18:35.379
It's the only thing
I've ever done.
这是唯一的事情
我曾经做过。

18:35.482 --> 18:37.689
SQUIDWARD:
Having fun down there,
SpongeBob?
章鱼哥：
在那里玩得很开心，
海绵宝宝？

18:37.793 --> 18:39.000
[ laughing]
[笑]

18:39.103 --> 18:41.655
Hi, Squidward.Patrick's down there, too?
嗨，章鱼哥。帕特里克也在下面吗？

18:41.758 --> 18:43.310
It just gets
better and better.
它只是得到
越来越好。

18:43.413 --> 18:44.551
Do you want
to make a wish?
你想要吗
许愿吗？

18:44.655 --> 18:46.793
Ha! Ha! I got mywish.
哈!哈!我如愿以偿了。

18:46.896 --> 18:50.586
You two are stuck in a dark hole
and away from me.
你们两个被困在黑洞里
并远离我。

18:50.689 --> 18:51.586
Guess what, Squidward?
你猜怎么着，章鱼哥？

18:51.689 --> 18:52.620
We found the magic.
我们发现了魔法。

18:52.724 --> 18:54.551
[ laughing]
[笑]

18:54.655 --> 18:56.931
There's no magic, SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝，没有魔法。

18:57.034 --> 19:00.862
Wishing wells are just a scam
to fool saps like you.
许愿井只是一个骗局
去愚弄像你这样的傻瓜。

19:00.965 --> 19:02.586
[ laughing]
[笑]

19:02.689 --> 19:03.551
No, it's true.
不，这是真的。

19:03.655 --> 19:04.965
We didfind the magic.
我们确实找到了魔力。

19:05.068 --> 19:06.517
Oh, I wish you
could see it.
哦，我希望你
可以看到它。

19:06.620 --> 19:09.620
Ha, ha, ha... oop!
哈哈哈哈……哎呀！

19:11.206 --> 19:13.965
Squidward, you decided
to join the party.
章鱼哥，你决定了
入党。

19:14.068 --> 19:14.965
Party!
派对！

19:15.068 --> 19:16.172
Let me outta here.
让我离开这里。

19:16.275 --> 19:18.241
We were just gonna
play some party games.
我们只是要
玩一些聚会游戏。

19:18.344 --> 19:19.793
Tag! You're it.Tag! You're it.
标签！就是你了。标记！你就是它。

19:19.896 --> 19:22.793
Tag!
You're it.
I gotta
get outta here.
标签！
你就是它。
我必须
离开这里。

19:24.724 --> 19:25.620
Go, Squidward!
Go, Squidward!
走吧，章鱼哥！
走吧，章鱼哥！

19:25.724 --> 19:27.103
Go, Squidward!
Go, Squidward!
走吧，章鱼哥！
走吧，章鱼哥！

19:27.206 --> 19:29.413
[ screaming, groaning ]
[尖叫、呻吟]

19:29.517 --> 19:31.551
There's no way
to climb outta here.
没有办法
爬出这里。

19:31.655 --> 19:33.310
Maybe if you had more
upper-arm strength.
也许如果你有更多
上臂力量。

19:33.413 --> 19:35.379
Yeah, you should
work out more.
是的，你应该
多锻炼。

19:35.482 --> 19:37.068
Well, why don't I just start
right now?
好吧，我为什么不开始呢
现在？

19:37.172 --> 19:39.793
After all, I got a couple
of dumbbells right here.
毕竟我有一对
哑铃就在这里。

19:39.896 --> 19:41.172
[ laughing]
[笑]

19:41.275 --> 19:42.241
I don't get it.
我不明白。

19:42.344 --> 19:43.620
Would you not
stand so close?
你不会吗
站得这么近？

19:43.724 --> 19:45.000
You're making me
claustrophobic.
你让我
幽闭恐惧症。

19:45.103 --> 19:46.862
What does
claustrophobic mean?
什么是
幽闭恐惧症是什么意思？

19:46.965 --> 19:48.586
It means he's afraid
of Santa Claus.
说明他害怕了
圣诞老人的。

19:48.689 --> 19:49.620
No, it doesn't!
不，没有！

19:49.724 --> 19:50.551
Ho, ho, ho!
嗬，嗬，嗬！

19:50.655 --> 19:51.724
[ giggling]
[咯咯笑]

19:51.827 --> 19:53.517
Stop it, Patrick,
you're scaring him!
别这样，帕特里克，
你吓到他了！

19:53.620 --> 19:55.103
Ho! Ho! Ho!
嗬！嗬！嗬！

19:55.206 --> 19:56.655
It's not working, Patrick.
这不起作用，帕特里克。

19:56.758 --> 19:57.689
Darn.
该死。

19:57.793 --> 19:58.655
Um, Squidward,
嗯，章鱼哥，

19:58.758 --> 19:59.931
You're standing
on my foot.
你站着
在我的脚上。

20:00.034 --> 20:01.413
Oops. Oh, sorry, SpongeBob.
哎呀。哦，对不起，海绵宝宝。

20:01.517 --> 20:03.517
And you got your elbow
in my ribs.
你还得到了你的肘部
在我的肋骨里。

20:03.620 --> 20:04.931
Eww.
呃。

20:06.103 --> 20:07.000
Patrick.
帕特里克.

20:07.103 --> 20:08.827
And stop stepping
in my potato salad.
并且停止脚步
在我的土豆沙拉里。

20:08.931 --> 20:10.103
Hey, hey, hey. Guys!
嘿，嘿，嘿。伙计们！

20:10.206 --> 20:12.137
Stop pushing me, Patrick.
别再逼我了，帕特里克。

20:12.241 --> 20:13.379
You mean like this?
你的意思是这样吗？

20:13.482 --> 20:14.896
No, like this!
不，像这样！

20:15.000 --> 20:15.862
[ slugging]
[重击]

20:15.965 --> 20:17.689
You shouldn't
fight in here.
你不应该
在这里战斗。

20:17.793 --> 20:20.068
This is a magical place.
这是一个神奇的地方。

20:20.172 --> 20:21.965
Patrick,
get off of me!
帕特里克，
放开我！

20:22.068 --> 20:24.379
[ slugging continues]
[继续打斗]

20:24.482 --> 20:26.724
I told you I am claustrophobic.
我告诉过你我有幽闭恐惧症。

20:26.827 --> 20:28.448
Nice try, Squidward,
不错的尝试，章鱼哥，

20:28.551 --> 20:31.172
but there's
no Santa Claus here.
但有
这里没有圣诞老人。

20:31.275 --> 20:32.758
SQUIDWARD:
Patrick!
章鱼哥：
帕特里克！

20:34.931 --> 20:36.965
Good morning, SpongeBob!
早上好，海绵宝宝！

20:37.068 --> 20:38.310
Let's see what you got.
让我们看看你得到了什么。

20:38.413 --> 20:39.965
Boy, it's heavy!
孩子，好重啊！

20:40.068 --> 20:41.413
Must be a lot of money.
一定是很多钱。

20:41.517 --> 20:44.482
Free! I'm free!
自由的！我自由了！

20:44.586 --> 20:47.379
Squidward? What were you
doing down there?
章鱼哥？你是什么
在那儿做什么？

20:47.482 --> 20:48.965
I didn't approve
any overtime.
我没有同意
任何加班。

20:49.068 --> 20:52.034
Or were you sneaking here,
in the dead of night,
或者你偷偷溜到这里，
在夜深人静的时候，

20:52.137 --> 20:53.517
for free wishes?
为了自由的愿望？

20:53.620 --> 20:58.103
The only thing I wish for
is to be far away from here.
我唯一的愿望
就是要离这里很远。

20:59.620 --> 21:02.896
Ow.
噢。

21:03.000 --> 21:03.896
Bye, Squidward.
再见，章鱼哥。

21:04.000 --> 21:05.275
Enjoy your trip.
祝您旅途愉快。

21:05.379 --> 21:07.103
Lucky.
幸运的。

21:07.206 --> 21:09.206
So how much money
did you make last night?
那么多少钱
你昨晚做了吗？

21:09.310 --> 21:10.758
We didn't get any money,
我们没有拿到钱，

21:10.862 --> 21:12.758
but we found
something better.
但我们发现
更好的东西。

21:12.862 --> 21:13.965
We found the magic.
我们发现了魔法。

21:14.068 --> 21:15.206
The what?
什么？

21:15.310 --> 21:18.482
We dug down deeper in the well
and found the magic!
我们把井挖得更深
并发现了魔法！

21:18.586 --> 21:20.275
Now all the wishes
will come true.
现在所有的愿望
将会实现。

21:20.379 --> 21:22.241
Listen closely, SpongeBob.
仔细听，海绵宝宝。

21:22.344 --> 21:25.172
You don't get what you want in
life just by wishing for it.
你没有得到你想要的东西
生活只是因为渴望它。

21:25.275 --> 21:27.206
[ shrieking]
[尖叫]

21:27.310 --> 21:28.793
What in the deep blue is that?
那深蓝色的是什么？

21:28.896 --> 21:31.241
There's a full moon out tonight.
今晚有满月。

21:31.344 --> 21:34.034
Do you like my new
telescope I wished for?
你喜欢我的新作品吗
我想要的望远镜？

21:34.137 --> 21:35.620
That's great, Sandy.
太好了，桑迪。

21:35.724 --> 21:37.931
That wishing well
sure does work.
那口许愿井
当然有效。

21:38.034 --> 21:39.931
Just a coincidence.
只是巧合而已。

21:40.965 --> 21:42.965
What do you think
of my new hotrod?
你觉得怎么样
我的新改装车？

21:43.068 --> 21:44.620
It's beautiful,
Mrs. Puff.
很漂亮，
泡芙女士。

21:44.724 --> 21:46.482
How's about letting me
take it for a spin?
让我怎么样
试一试？

21:46.586 --> 21:48.793
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

21:48.896 --> 21:50.034
No.
不。

21:52.310 --> 21:54.724
See, Mr. Krabs?
She wished for that boat.
看到了吗，蟹老板？
她想要那条船。

21:54.827 --> 21:56.793
You mean she stole
that boat.
你的意思是她偷了
那条船。

21:59.034 --> 22:01.344
Morning, SpongeBob, Krabs.
早上好，海绵宝宝，蟹蟹。

22:01.448 --> 22:02.517
Beautiful day.
美好的一天。

22:02.620 --> 22:09.310
[ crazed laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

22:09.413 --> 22:11.034
Is that proof enough for you?
这对你来说足够证明了吗？

22:11.137 --> 22:13.413
You'll never get me
to believe in magic. Never!
你永远得不到我
相信魔法。绝不！

22:13.517 --> 22:14.620
Just to prove it to you,
只是为了向你证明，

22:14.724 --> 22:16.275
I'll demonstrate.
我来演示一下。

22:16.379 --> 22:19.068
I wish I was steamed
我希望我被蒸了

22:19.172 --> 22:21.724
and served with a side
of melted butter.
配菜
融化的黄油。

22:21.827 --> 22:23.310
[ laughing]
[笑]

22:23.413 --> 22:26.034
Mr. Krabs! No!
蟹老板！不！

22:26.137 --> 22:29.000
Well, where's your
magic now?
那么，你在哪里
现在魔法吗？

22:30.517 --> 22:32.862
Oh, where am I?
噢，我在哪儿？

22:33.827 --> 22:35.103
What's going on here?
这是怎么回事？

22:35.206 --> 22:36.068
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

22:36.172 --> 22:37.344
I dobelieve in magic.
我确实相信魔法。

22:37.448 --> 22:38.965
I do believe in magic.
I do believe in magic.
我确实相信魔法。
我确实相信魔法。

22:39.068 --> 22:40.551
Oh, no...!
哦，不……！

